{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-14T09:51:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011375591673807270"],"id":"2011375591673807270","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":19992,"like_count":64,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":47,"retweet_count":2},"text":"中专没读完就辍学网恋奔现，见面不到一个月就吵架闹分手，说好的他家里是开厂子的，我不用读书和他经营厂子就行，结果他是画大饼的，他家根本就没有厂子，现在好了爱情也输的一塌糊涂，我连中专都没读完这不就是当代文盲吗？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2011375591673807270"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-14T07:08:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011334604461130097"],"id":"2011334604461130097","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15992,"like_count":53,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":2},"text":"真不明白偷外卖那人得有多困难，送好几单外卖我才能挣回那十几块，虽然不多但让我体验到了社会的奸险，没出社会之前我以为世界上都是好人","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2011334604461130097"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-14T01:45:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011253422000128272"],"id":"2011253422000128272","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20935,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":1},"text":"好日子要来了！外地打工的老乡们都回来吧，咱家乡也是好起来了～ https://t.co/naj7xL29Vc","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2011253422000128272"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-13T17:09:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011123345643999501"],"id":"2011123345643999501","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8511,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2011084589507440865","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"声明一下！我并没有堕落，只因为他给我拍了我想看的东西，我认为占了他的便宜，并且前一个过分的要求我已经拒绝了，只是发语音听一下，我觉得欠了他的人情应该还，更何况听听紫薇的声音这也不算我堕落吧？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2011123345643999501"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-13T14:35:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011084589507440865"],"id":"2011084589507440865","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":34665,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":1},"text":"也就现在想听可以给你听，像之前和我爸妈一块住我躲在被窝弄，不敢大喘气一直忍着，还是独立自己租房住的方便，破喉咙都没人理 https://t.co/zO48RIYSBy","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2011084589507440865"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-13T12:50:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011058286527988197"],"id":"2011058286527988197","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":40828,"like_count":135,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":72,"retweet_count":1},"text":"在我们山西这个扫大街都需要关系户的地方，家里人如果不能托举，靠自己基本很难找到一份好工作了，有机会我一定会去南方闯闯","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2011058286527988197"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-13T09:30:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011007877759238543"],"id":"2011007877759238543","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":18036,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"欢迎20岁的小姐姐加入站点 https://t.co/XTPBnZ9Uw1","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2011007877759238543"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-13T06:32:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010963178629521739"],"id":"2010963178629521739","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":48678,"like_count":201,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":61,"retweet_count":4},"text":"钱难挣，屎难吃，国内就业环境太内卷了，对于我这种没念完书的人来说只能干些体力工作，我爸妈那个年代上过高中就能找个很不错的工作了","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010963178629521739"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-13T01:39:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010889381243208157"],"id":"2010889381243208157","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10815,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":1},"text":"昨天给顾客送餐途中，车上的外卖被偷了我没报警处理，因为十几块的东西浪费一整天时间不值得，影响挣钱不说弄不好还得在搭进去份打车钱，算了，第一次遇到也算是给我敲个警钟，以后要多注意了，可能偷外卖那人也有什么难处吧","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010889381243208157"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-12T13:00:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010698462686478435"],"id":"2010698462686478435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":24397,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":0},"text":"乃格兰货我凭啥让你干？ https://t.co/B8nYilEOTo","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010698462686478435"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-12T10:59:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010667980875768105"],"id":"2010667980875768105","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13458,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我一个人住，每晚下班回家屋里静悄悄的，掉根针都听的清清楚楚，这种安静孤独的氛围好难受，本来想养只小猫陪着我的，但房东不让养动物，我快无聊死了...","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010667980875768105"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-12T06:30:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010600199811645730"],"id":"2010600199811645730","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14828,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":1},"text":"终于被偷餐了，还好价格不高，赔了11块。本来以为过了新手期，咱也成了老司机了，送单基本上可以算是小菜一碟了，没想到今天就被偷餐了，幸好顾客心好，看我冻的脸发青，也就没跟我计较了，只是按原价赔了。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010600199811645730"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-12T01:28:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010524370956079447"],"id":"2010524370956079447","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":18443,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":39,"retweet_count":0},"text":"送完餐发现其他外卖被偷了怎么办？ https://t.co/epq3vQsL8j","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010524370956079447"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-11T13:59:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010350863467118786"],"id":"2010350863467118786","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":74,"impression_count":137205,"like_count":372,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":227,"retweet_count":7},"text":"没有父母托举，自己又不争气辍学了，加上国内市场这么卷，找个像样点的工作真难，总不可能我要送一辈子外卖吧？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010350863467118786"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-11T07:17:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010249622783177076"],"id":"2010249622783177076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15867,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你们刷到这个视频没？\n网友昨天刚建议我买身财神衣服，和财神贴纸到街上商铺送财神求打赏，今天我就刷到有个女大学生送财神火了，可以给两块吗？我这个进价1.5...","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010249622783177076"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-11T02:21:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010175247711092772"],"id":"2010175247711092772","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12932,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2010175205147324423","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"目前不考虑收徒","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010175247711092772"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-11T02:21:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010175205147324423"],"id":"2010175205147324423","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25938,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"text":"颜色有点不对劲，但依旧香香软软 https://t.co/FqubewjoMa","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2010175205147324423"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-10T14:30:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2009996266554695744"],"id":"2009996266554695744","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":67376,"like_count":108,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":59,"retweet_count":1},"text":"网友分享给我个比送外卖要强的工作，就是买一身财神的衣服cos财神爷，在进一箱财神贴纸，背几段祝福语，然后到街上每家店铺拜年接财神，然后店家会看心意给你qian，我觉得这个主意不错，你们觉得呢？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2009996266554695744"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-10T06:38:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2009877615092609100"],"id":"2009877615092609100","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":60961,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"关于dy账号我就不公布了，这里我发帖是为了排解压力，发发牢骚找点存在感，dy作品上有露脸照片就不方便透露了 https://t.co/A2dMU1xNst","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2009877615092609100"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-10T02:05:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2009808719748706369"],"id":"2009808719748706369","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":39207,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我往常送外卖的时候会哼点小曲解压，昨天录的那条视频看到还有人夸我唱功好，蛤蛤，在好也没昨天屋子里doi那两人叫的声大，我感觉他邻居也听到他两doi了","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2009808719748706369"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-09T15:09:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2009643590298030589"],"id":"2009643590298030589","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":47787,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我家里还有个哥哥，他还没娶媳妇，我爸的意思是反正当初不想念书，既然辍学那正好在家里陪我妈打理店铺就别读了，我哥以后娶媳妇彩礼呀车子房子这都需要钱，家庭本身也不富裕。","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2009643590298030589"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-09T12:11:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2009598812768383354"],"id":"2009598812768383354","in_reply_to_user_id":"1880947070837964800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":127931,"like_count":144,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2009598197325611435","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"谁能想到送个外卖能遇到这事？刚开始上楼听着像是有人在家暴，哭声很大，小时候父母经常打架，所以我第一时间想的就是报警，但是离的越近越不对劲...","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2009598812768383354"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-09T12:08:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2009598197325611435"],"id":"2009598197325611435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1024,"impression_count":1852957,"like_count":4026,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":192,"retweet_count":121},"text":"晚一秒我就报警了... https://t.co/7z3m4Vpmyw","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2009598197325611435"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-13T14:35:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2011084589507440865"],"id":"2011084589507440865","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":34665,"like_count":42,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":1},"text":"也就现在想听可以给你听，像之前和我爸妈一块住我躲在被窝弄，不敢大喘气一直忍着，还是独立自己租房住的方便，破喉咙都没人理 https://t.co/zO48RIYSBy"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-11T02:21:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2010175205147324423"],"id":"2010175205147324423","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25938,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"text":"颜色有点不对劲，但依旧香香软软 https://t.co/FqubewjoMa"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-01-09T12:08:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2009598197325611435"],"id":"2009598197325611435","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1024,"impression_count":1852957,"like_count":4026,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":192,"retweet_count":121},"text":"晚一秒我就报警了... https://t.co/7z3m4Vpmyw"}],"users":[{"id":"1880947070837964800","name":"瑶瑶睡不着💤","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2075590220117094400/Lvbru8uj_normal.jpg","username":"Guillermin45548","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2011375591673807270","oldest_id":"2009598197325611435","previous_token":"77qpymm88g5h9vqkmfmrvj27g1n8yl2jvi65ny5552vxs","result_count":23}}